    "detailed_description": "An exciting tower defense game where you have to defend your island from the invasion of enemy forces.<br />\r\nYour task is to build and upgrade towers to repel waves of attacking enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBecome a true commander, place defensive structures on the island, and don't let enemies penetrate the territory!<br />\r\nYour strategic thinking and ability to effectively use resources will be key in this struggle for survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- 3D Graphics<br />\r\n- Five types of towers: You have access to five different types of towers for defense. Each tower has its own unique characteristics. Choose wisely to effectively deal with enemies.<br />\r\n- Variety of enemies: A variety of enemies await you in the game.<br />\r\n- Strategic thinking: Place towers so that they cover the most vulnerable points of the island and effectively restrain enemies.",
